# メニュー → 状態の一覧（pager）→ q → 再読み込み → q → 戻る → 終了
Output docs/screens/menu-status.gif
Output docs/screens/menu-status.txt
Source docs/tapes/_settings.tape
Source docs/tapes/_env.tape

Hide
Type "mkdir -p /tmp/vrs-log && clear"
Enter
Show

Type "versteck-remote-tui"
Enter
Sleep 1.5s
Enter
Sleep 1.5s
Type "q"
Sleep 1s
Enter
Sleep 1.5s
Type "q"
Sleep 1s
Down
Sleep 0.5s
Enter
Sleep 1s
Down@200ms 6
Sleep 0.5s
Enter
Sleep 1s
